# Component

AdsSearchPanel

---

# Purpose

AdsSearchPanel is the standard search component for all GoldenCell Admin list pages.

It provides a consistent interface for searching, filtering, resetting conditions, and managing advanced search options.

AdsSearchPanel contains no business logic.

Its responsibility is limited to rendering search controls and handling user interactions.

---

# Design Principles

- Business Independent
- Metadata Driven
- Reusable
- Type Safe
- Accessible
- Production Ready

---

# Technology Standard

- React
- TypeScript
- react-hook-form
- Zod
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui

---

# Responsibilities

AdsSearchPanel SHALL

- Render search fields
- Render action buttons
- Support advanced search
- Support loading state
- Submit search values
- Reset search values

AdsSearchPanel SHALL NOT

- Fetch data
- Call APIs
- Perform business validation
- Manage domain state
- Know any business rules

