# Layout Rules

The component shall follow

- DOC-102 ADS Layout System
- 12 Column Grid
- 8px Spacing System

Search actions remain right aligned.

---

# Search Actions

Order

Secondary

- Reset

Primary

- Search

Primary Action must always remain in a predictable position.

---

# Advanced Search

If enabled

Default

Collapsed

User may expand additional search conditions.

Expanded state is managed internally.

---

# Event Flow

```
User Input

↓

react-hook-form

↓

Submit

↓

onSearch()

↓

Parent Component

↓

API Call
